# Improved FLTR: the FILTER graph for BW at five widths from FRQ 48 (220 Hz): RES 20, 52, 72, 102, 127
# (4.7, 24.4, 33.8, 47.8, 59.5 semitones), each graph box against a reference recorded from screens
# checked by eye. Changes the BD sound's FILTER FRQ, RES and TYP; ends on TYP 0 (LP2), FRQ 127, RES 0.
name: if-graph
state: changes
target: emu
hold TRK
key BD
release TRK
key FLTR
wait 1500
cc 74 48
cc 76 7
cc 75 20
wait 3500
screen w20
expect w20 == ref region 0 30 64 18
cc 75 52
wait 3500
screen w52
expect w52 == ref region 0 30 64 18
cc 75 72
wait 3500
screen w72
expect w72 == ref region 0 30 64 18
cc 75 102
wait 3500
screen w102
expect w102 == ref region 0 30 64 18
cc 75 127
wait 3500
screen w127
expect w127 == ref region 0 30 64 18
cc 76 0
cc 74 127
cc 75 0
